        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ringo Starr, Ian Hunter, Paul Barrere, Howard Jones, Roger Hodgson, Sheila E, Greg Lake, Christopher Cross\n- Organizations: Ringo Starr and Friends, Mott the Hoople, Little Feat\n- Songs: \"Ride Like the Wind\"\n\nFacts:\n- Ian Hunter of Mott the Hoople was a member of Ringo Starr and Friends.\n- Paul Barrere was a member of Little Feat.\n- The song \"Ride Like the Wind\" was dedicated to Paul Barrere.\n- Ian Hunter was born before Paul Barrere.\n- Other people in Ringo Starr and Friends included Howard Jones, Roger Hodgson, Sheila E, Greg Lake, and Hunter.",
